# What does a day's work look like? Bruegel's The Harvesters
tags: ["bruegel","renaissance art","labor and work","daily life painting","social history"]
teaches: ["art-history/genre-painting","visual-analysis/composition","history/peasant-life","methods/visual-storytelling"]
